Z||000029||lou_dias||12-07-2001||11:45 AM||||There was a fix on the internet that detailed taking the PS apart.  What would happen is the rail that the head that moved back and forth would wear out and the angle of the laser would be off.  I inserted a 1 cm square thin piece of metal underneath it and no more problems playing games.<P>uh my cousin has a modded..uh I mean enhanced...(wink wink) PS1 and like a hundred games for sale for like $150 obo includes 2 controllers and a memory pak or 2.<P>email me if interested...make an offer||||reg||1
